{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:00 2026-05-09 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:00 2026-05-09 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:00 2026-05-09 HKT</p><img alt=\"荃灣工廈起火濃煙滾滾 消防拖喉升雲梯灌救\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/9ec3dbe009cc6a6019378eb1b0d7cf0b/2026-05/collage_18.jpg\"/><p>荃灣橫龍街55至57號一工業大廈，今日（5月9日）下午近5時中層有單位發生火警。現場雖未見明火，但滾滾濃煙冒出籠罩街道。消防接報趕至，動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，並升起雲梯在外戒備。火警其後被救係，初步無人受傷，起火原因仍在調查。</p><img alt=\"現場為荃灣橫龍街55至57號一工業大廈。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b4b5f4235fa6b4772c5aa28820c58af9/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260509_174656126_05.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2b3ee6f792692543c5ce8fb2083ad4cc/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260509_175117389_02.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防升起雲梯在外戒備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/289e35e94902dbbf7f24f020ab4217b6/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260509_174656126_11.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防升起雲梯在外戒備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e0a4e7bbc422bf9759d2ae4f28a31ae6/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260509_174656126_08.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場濃煙滾滾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0ec74d7ec7675d4cbad9f818c28949ef/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260509_174656126_07.jpg\"/><img alt=\"現場濃煙滾滾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f664b108504d5f03308b17238d7794bc/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260509_174656126_02.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-09T10:35:45.540018+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}